hing the 4 different Game Modes you'll find in Too Hot to Hold. That's right! A new mode was added just recently - HIDE & SEEK as requested by players and playtesters! Each of the 4 Game Modes have its own rules, tricks and ways to cause absolute chaos. Here's how they work! 1. MAIN (Hot Potato). Pass it or well, BOOM.This is our main Game Mode and it's pretty","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:01:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033062","verified_at":"2026-10-22T18:54:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5199210-1845383656397332","game_id":"steam-5199210","kind":"announcement","title":"Announce: Public Demo Release!","summary":"Grab your friends. The Too Hot To Hold Demo is officially LIVE on Steam! Too Hot To Hold is an up-to-10-player asymmetric multiplayer party game where tiny Tricksters must keep a burning Ember alive while armed Wardens hunt them down and try to shoot it apart. 10 SECONDS.Grab the Ember. Run. Pass it to somebody else before it blows up in your hands.Preferably somebody you don’t mind upsetting.WHAT’S IN THE DEMO?UP TO 10-PLAYER MULTIPLAYERBring your friends into customizable online lobbies and de","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T18:39:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397332","verified_at":"2026-10-21T00:16:23Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5199210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:29:08Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T09:29:07Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5199210":"2026-10-26T09:29:08Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5199210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:29:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T09:29:07Z","status":"ok","error